msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Check it out! A brand-name bag! All the hostesses love these babies. 70,000 "
"yen at retail, but I can cut you a deal..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Well? How does 50,000 sound?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "I'll consider it. Why are you selling this here, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Oh, y'know, I used to have my own store, but... went out of business. You "
"know how it is. This economy, am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"Still got a lot of debt to work through, so I gotta make money somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"But if I try to sell my goods to a wholesaler, they beat the price way down."
" And every little bit helps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "I see what you mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"So listen, all I'd need is 50,000 yen, and... No, 40,000 yen, and the bag's "
"yours! You'd really be helping me out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Okay, sure. 40,000 yen's a good deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "You handed over the money and got the bag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Thank you! Trust me, no woman alive can resist a gift like this. Yessir, you"
" got yourself a winner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Okay, buddy, see you 'round! Heheheh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Sorry. You'll have to ask someone else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's a shame... See, this is quality merchandise here. Real top-notch "
"stuff⑬and I'd know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Well, if you change your mind, come on back! I'll still be here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "I might be interested if you can bring the price down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"Are you serious? This bag is worth 70,000 yen! If I drop it below 40,000, "
"there's no profit left!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Then I guess you'll have to ask somebody else."
msgstr ""

